# GitHub Linguist: language statistics & diff hygiene.
#
# wipnote commits its canonical work-item store as HTML under .wipnote/. Those
# files are GENERATED by the CLI (regenerated on every mutation) — they are the
# project's data/artifact layer, not hand-authored source. Without the markers
# below, GitHub classifies the repo as ~68% HTML and buries the Go codebase.

# Canonical wipnote store — generated artifacts. Exclude from language stats
# and collapse in diffs.
.wipnote/** linguist-generated

# Go test scratch output that leaked into the tree — treat as generated so it
# never counts toward language stats. (Untracking these is tracked separately.)
.gotest/**     linguist-generated
.gotest-tmp/** linguist-generated
tmp/**         linguist-generated

# Legacy archived dashboard + example apps — not the product's primary source.
archive/**  linguist-vendored
examples/** linguist-documentation
